## Sprint goal
Establish one manifest, one registry, one deterministic fixture gauge, and one model gauge.

## Carrier

Operator/gauge schemas, licenses, capabilities, fixture gauges, and conformance tests.

## Primitive Difference

No verified registry proves runtime substitution preserves semantics, permissions, ceilings, and witnesses.

## ZeroRel

Bindings are equivalent when inputs, outputs, permissions, licenses, writes, witnesses, and ceilings match.

## Cochain realization

**Realization:** Structural

### C0

Operators, gauges, capabilities, licenses, evidence.

### C1

Binding and capability edges.

### C2

Semantic, permission, privacy, and evidence consistency.

### d0

Maps manifests to capability/witness edges.

### d1

Maps edges to incompatibility, privilege expansion, or evidence loss.

### d1 o d0 witness

Gauge substitution cannot change operator contract or authority ceiling.

## Q1

Binding differences modulo declared adapter equivalence.

## Phi1 before

Missing registry, fixture gauge, and substitution tests.

## Gamma2 risks

Hidden context, tool drift, privacy, nondeterminism.

## Frozen observer

Registry implementer with fixtures and no production credentials.

## Witness plan and evidence ceiling

Manifest/fixture conformance.

## Licensed operators and lifts

Schema registration, fixture adapters, capability tests.

## Survivor routing

Capability missing -> `OperatorNeeded`; expansion -> `LiftLicenseNeeded`; runtime absent -> infrastructure.

## Story roster

### STORY S02-001-01 - Define registry

**LifecycleStatus:** BLOCKED

#### Goal

Define registry.

#### Primitive Difference

Contracts are not closed.

#### Carrier and exact write surface

Manifest/license files.

#### Preconditions and dependencies

S01-001 promoted.

