### STORY S02-001-02 - Implement fixture gauge

**LifecycleStatus:** BLOCKED

#### Goal

Implement fixture gauge.

#### Primitive Difference

No provider-neutral control exists.

#### Carrier and exact write surface

Fixture adapter/tests.

#### Preconditions and dependencies

After story 01.

#### Licensed operations

Implement deterministic no-network gauge.

#### Acceptance criteria

- Typed I/O executes.
- No undeclared tools/writes.

#### Evidence receipts

Fixture receipt.

#### Survivor route

Unavailable -> infrastructure.

#### Nonclaims

